calculateBaseline(records, indicators, window, options) returns the mean,
sample standard deviation and reading count per indicator over a fixed,
inclusive window of mission days (DECISIONS › Baselines: fixed, not
rolling). Plain browser-safe JavaScript with JSDoc; no React, DOM or
Node-only APIs.

- Missing or invalid values are skipped and counted, never filled in.
- Fewer than minReadings (default 2) gives insufficient_data / no_data
  with null numbers.
- Deterministic: values are sorted before summing, so record order
  cannot change the result; output is frozen and inputs are untouched.
- 14 tests with node:test; run with `npm test`.

Records the calculator's choices in DECISIONS.md, ticks the checklist
item and logs AI use.

