(ADA), fever and hypothermia (CDC), sleep (CDC), each checked against the
live page on 14 Nov 2026 and written in our own words. Lists the red
limits no allowed source gives (heart rate, high glucose, high temperature,
low blood pressure, SpO2) for the team to decide. Units: mg/dL.

