Plain-JavaScript engine in src/lib/engine/ (no React, DOM, database or
network; MiniSearch is the only dependency, already installed). Every
function is marked with the checklist item it satisfies.

- 7-day average (at least 4 readings) and the locked drift z-score
  against the fixed in-flight baseline, with a per-indicator minimum s
- Status per indicator: no data, steady, drifting, expected adaptation
- Alert levels (note, alert, escalated after 14 days) with blood pressure
  and reaction counted once
- Red-limit check on every reading, using only AHA/ADA/CDC values
  verified in docs/SOURCES.md, each cited and labelled
- Health score 0-100 with caps 79/59/25, bands and day/week change
- Reaction scoring, reminder scheduler, mission evaluator
- Search over MiniSearch (typos, prefixes, keywords, symptoms first,
  "did you mean"), region mapper, surgeon summary, calendar scheduler,
  Scenario Lab data injection
- 76 tests incl. 180-day seeded missions (healthy, slow decline, bad
  day, red limit, missing days)

README states the z = 3.5 cut-off as a design choice; DECISIONS records
every assumption; CHECKLIST ticked or marked partial; AI use logged.

